{
  "info": {
    "name": "S1 - IoT Ingestion (MQTT → Database → RabbitMQ)",
    "description": "Skenario 1: IoT Sensor data collection from MQTT → stored in database → published to RabbitMQ\n\nFlow:\n1. IoT Simulator publishes sensor data to MQTT\n2. Node-RED subscribes and transforms data\n3. Data stored in MySQL (irr_sensor_readings)\n4. Event published to RabbitMQ (sensor.new topic)\n5. ML Service consumes event",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "1.0 LOGIN - Get Token (Required First!)",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "exec": [
              "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
              "    var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
              "    pm.environment.set('token_petani', jsonData.access_token);",
              "    console.log('✅ Token Petani set:', jsonData.access_token.substring(0, 50) + '...');",
              "} else {",
              "    console.log('❌ Login failed. Status:', pm.response.code);",
              "}"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/x-www-form-urlencoded"
          }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "urlencoded",
          "urlencoded": [
            {
              "key": "grant_type",
              "value": "password"
            },
            {
              "key": "username",
              "value": "farmer@agri.com"
            },
            {
              "key": "password",
              "value": "farmer123"
            },
            {
              "key": "client_id",
              "value": "web-app"
            },
            {
              "key": "client_secret",
              "value": "web_secret_123"
            }
          ]
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{oauth_url}}/oauth/token",
          "host": ["{{oauth_url}}"],
          "path": ["oauth", "token"]
        },
        "description": "🔐 LOGIN: Dapatkan OAuth token terlebih dahulu\n\nEndpoint ini adalah STEP PERTAMA yang WAJIB dijalankan sebelum request lain di S1!\n\nResponse:\n- access_token: JWT token untuk authentication\n- refresh_token: Token untuk refresh\n- expires_in: 3600 detik (1 jam)\n\nToken auto-disimpan ke environment variable 'token_petani' via test script.\n\nCredentials:\n- Email: farmer@agri.com\n- Password: farmer123\n- Role: petani"
      },
      "response": []
    },
    {
      "name": "1.1 Check IoT Simulator Health",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{base_url}}/health",
          "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
          "path": ["health"]
        },
        "description": "Verify API Gateway and all upstream services are healthy"
      },
      "response": []
    },
    {
      "name": "1.2 Simulate IoT Sensor Data (POST to IoT endpoint)",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('Response status is 201 Created', function () {",
              "    pm.response.to.have.status(201);",
              "});",
              "",
              "pm.test('Response has sensor data', function () {",
              "    var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
              "    pm.expect(jsonData.status).to.eql('success');",
              "    pm.expect(jsonData.code).to.eql(201);",
              "    pm.expect(jsonData.data.zone_id).to.eql(parseInt(pm.environment.get('zone_id')));",
              "    pm.expect(jsonData.data.moisture).to.eql(65.5);",
              "    console.log('✅ Sensor data stored. ID:', jsonData.data.id);",
              "});",
              "",
              "pm.test('Data published to RabbitMQ', function () {",
              "    var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
              "    pm.expect(jsonData.message).to.include('published successfully');",
              "});"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          },
          {
            "key": "Authorization",
            "value": "Bearer {{token_petani}}",
            "type": "text"
          }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"zone_id\": {{zone_id}},\n  \"moisture\": 65.5,\n  \"temperature\": 28.5,\n  \"air_temp\": 32,\n  \"ph\": 6.8,\n  \"nitrogen\": 120,\n  \"phosphorus\": 75,\n  \"potassium\": 150,\n  \"air_humidity\": 70,\n  \"light_lux\": 8500\n}"
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{base_url}}/iot/sensor",
          "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
          "path": ["iot", "sensor"]
        },
        "description": "Simulasi IoT sensor mengirim data ke IoT endpoint. Data akan:\n1. Disimpan ke MySQL (irr_sensor_readings table)\n2. Dipublikasikan ke RabbitMQ (sensor.new topic)\n3. Diproses oleh ML Service\n\n✅ Token sudah tersedia dari 1.0 LOGIN step (auto-saved ke token_petani)"
      },
      "response": []
    },
    {
      "name": "1.3 Get Latest Sensor Reading (via Gateway)",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('Response status is 200 OK', function () {",
              "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
              "});",
              "",
              "pm.test('Latest sensor reading retrieved', function () {",
              "    var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
              "    pm.expect(jsonData.status).to.eql('success');",
              "    pm.expect(jsonData.data).to.be.an('object');",
              "    pm.expect(jsonData.data.zone_id).to.eql(parseInt(pm.environment.get('zone_id')));",
              "    pm.expect(jsonData.data.moisture).to.exist;",
              "    pm.expect(jsonData.data.temperature).to.exist;",
              "    console.log('✅ Latest sensor ID:', jsonData.data.id, 'Moisture:', jsonData.data.moisture + '%');",
              "});"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          },
          {
            "key": "Authorization",
            "value": "Bearer {{token_petani}}",
            "type": "text"
          }
        ],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/sensors/current?zone_id={{zone_id}}",
          "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
          "path": ["api", "sensors", "current"],
          "query": [
            {
              "key": "zone_id",
              "value": "{{zone_id}}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "description": "Verifikasi sensor data tersimpan di database. Ambil via gateway dengan authentication.\n\n✅ Token sudah tersedia dari 1.0 LOGIN step (auto-saved ke token_petani)"
      },
      "response": []
    },
    {
      "name": "1.4 Get Sensor History (via Gateway)",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('Response status is 200 OK', function () {",
              "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
              "});",
              "",
              "pm.test('Sensor history retrieved (array)', function () {",
              "    var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
              "    pm.expect(jsonData.status).to.eql('success');",
              "    pm.expect(jsonData.data).to.be.an('array');",
              "    pm.expect(jsonData.data.length).to.be.greaterThan(0);",
              "    console.log('✅ Found', jsonData.data.length, 'sensor readings in history');",
              "});"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          },
          {
            "key": "Authorization",
            "value": "Bearer {{token_petani}}",
            "type": "text"
          }
        ],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/sensors/history?zone_id={{zone_id}}&start_date=2026-06-01&end_date=2026-06-30",
          "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
          "path": ["api", "sensors", "history"],
          "query": [
            {
              "key": "zone_id",
              "value": "{{zone_id}}"
            },
            {
              "key": "start_date",
              "value": "2026-06-01"
            },
            {
              "key": "end_date",
              "value": "2026-06-30"
            }
          ]
        },
        "description": "Ambil history sensor readings untuk period tertentu. Berguna untuk analisis trend.\n\n✅ Token sudah tersedia dari 1.0 LOGIN step (auto-saved ke token_petani)"
      },
      "response": []
    },
    {
      "name": "1.5 Check Prometheus Metrics",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('Response status is 200 OK', function () {",
              "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
              "});",
              "",
              "pm.test('Prometheus targets active', function () {",
              "    var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
              "    pm.expect(jsonData.status).to.eql('success');",
              "    pm.expect(jsonData.data.activeTargets).to.be.an('array');",
              "    pm.expect(jsonData.data.activeTargets.length).to.be.greaterThan(0);",
              "    console.log('✅ Prometheus scraping', jsonData.data.activeTargets.length, 'targets');",
              "});"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{prometheus_url}}/api/v1/targets",
          "host": ["{{prometheus_url}}"],
          "path": ["api", "v1", "targets"]
        },
        "description": "Verifikasi Prometheus dapat scrape metrics dari semua services termasuk IoT sensor data metrics"
      },
      "response": []
    },
    {
      "name": "1.6 Query Prometheus Sensor Metrics",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('Response status is 200 OK', function () {",
              "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
              "});",
              "",
              "pm.test('Sensor metrics available in Prometheus', function () {",
              "    var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
              "    pm.expect(jsonData.status).to.eql('success');",
              "    pm.expect(jsonData.data.resultType).to.eql('vector');",
              "    if (jsonData.data.result.length > 0) {",
              "        var total = jsonData.data.result[0].value[1];",
              "        console.log('✅ Total sensor readings:', total);",
              "    } else {",
              "        console.log('⚠️ No metrics available yet - run step 1.2 first');",
              "    }",
              "});"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{prometheus_url}}/api/v1/query?query=irr_sensor_readings_total",
          "host": ["{{prometheus_url}}"],
          "path": ["api", "v1", "query"],
          "query": [
            {
              "key": "query",
              "value": "irr_sensor_readings_total"
            }
          ]
        },
        "description": "Query Prometheus untuk total sensor readings yang tersimpan"
      },
      "response": []
    }
  ],
  "variable": []
}
